<% title = "Refund Policy" %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="page-header"><h1>Refund Policy</h1></section>
<div class="container prose">
  <h2>Subscription Refunds</h2>
  <p>We want you to be fully satisfied with your Kindwell subscription. Here's our straightforward refund policy:</p>
  
  <h3>First Purchase — 7 Day Guarantee</h3>
  <p>If this is your first subscription to Kindwell and you're not satisfied within the first 7 days, contact us at <strong>refunds@kindwell.org</strong> for a full refund. No questions asked.</p>
  
  <h3>Ongoing Subscriptions</h3>
  <p>After the initial 7-day period, subscriptions are billed monthly and are non-refundable for the current billing cycle. You can cancel at any time to prevent future charges — your access continues until the end of your paid period.</p>
  
  <h3>How to Cancel</h3>
  <p>Manage or cancel your subscription through your Stripe account (the email receipt from Stripe contains a "Manage subscription" link) or contact us directly and we'll handle it for you.</p>
  
  <h2>Product Refunds</h2>
  <p>Products purchased through our store must be returned within 30 days of delivery in original, unopened condition for a full refund. Homeopathic remedies (pellets, liquid) cannot be returned once opened due to hygiene standards.</p>
  
  <p>Shipping costs are not refundable unless the return is due to our error (damaged, wrong item, etc.).</p>
  
  <h2>How to Request a Refund</h2>
  <p>Email <strong>refunds@kindwell.org</strong> with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your full name</li>
    <li>Email associated with your account</li>
    <li>Date of purchase</li>
    <li>Reason for refund request</li>
  </ul>
  
  <p>We respond to all refund requests within 2 business days. Approved refunds are processed to your original payment method within 5–10 business days.</p>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
